Passenger > "React SPA": request ride and view own history
Driver > "React SPA": availability and assigned pool
Admin > "React SPA": verification and fare settings
"React SPA" > "Express API": role-protected HTTP API
"Express API" > "MongoDB Atlas": accounts, fares, rides, pools, OTP
"Express API" > Cloudinary: profile photos
"Express API" > "Email SMTP": registration OTP

